{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/4c0f6d189d59a042e2ac6d5ce35afc8c.poster.avif?t=1761491348\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/4c0f6d189d59a042e2ac6d5ce35afc8c.webm?t=1761491348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digitalink</strong> is a psychological horror experience where every decision you make brings you closer to complete your daily task at Digitalink Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working in a high-security research facility, you're tasked with mapping the neural responses of a massive, unidentified creature. You\u2019ll scroll through 56 matrices and try to map out its brain under pressure. Each correct decision will bring you closer to completing the task. But soon you'll start to realize something is off about Digitalink Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/9fc9d151a8e9699a1625e56cbe763963.poster.avif?t=1761491348\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/9fc9d151a8e9699a1625e56cbe763963.webm?t=1761491348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/9fc9d151a8e9699a1625e56cbe763963.mp4?t=1761491348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What I Offer in Digitalink:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand the query, find a matching tile in limited time. Mistake? Ups. Run out of time? Ups. Be precise and fast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a teamwork. You are not in danger ONLY when you screw up. If ANY of employees make a mistake, you all will be exposed to mental images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every session can offer a new game, due to the creature's brain map generated procedurally.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not fighting the monster or running from it \u2014you're studying it. But do you even know what's going on really?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/2673c1fdd82d3a74eed795f8ea4d28dc.poster.avif?t=1761491348\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/2673c1fdd82d3a74eed795f8ea4d28dc.webm?t=1761491348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/2673c1fdd82d3a74eed795f8ea4d28dc.mp4?t=1761491348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447090/499b0f33da34a858ffcdb6cb629e659135036f36.jpg"},{"name":"Fired","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447090/8b5231993cf73dcdb4ead5ffb9ad8c7c85682173.jpg"},{"name":"Wise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447090/2e4f23383e2cf144e3687614d93477d722be7ce5.jpg"},{"name":"1st Scare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447090/0afa57c85ffc9ed55ff1c63d013fc72d1d8613d6.jpg"},{"name":"2nd Scare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447090/f40a97051bfa11b45da4ca5b85e2d07fa41e78e3.jpg"},{"name":"3rd Scare","path":"https://cdn.akama