e creature's brain map generated procedurally.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not fighting the monster or running from it \u2014you're studying it. But do you even know what's going on really?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/2673c1fdd82d3a74eed795f8ea4d28dc.poster.avif?t=1761491348\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/2673c1fdd82d3a74eed795f8ea4d28dc.webm?t=1761491348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/extras/2673c1fdd82d3a74eed795f8ea4d28dc.mp4?t=1761491348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Metgan Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447090/c56c6e81a176c6ecde03d90bdb035d0ee7dfabcd/header.jpg?t=1761491348","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3447090/1660858832/a0dc68336a50d4816e8b308405406299bbff6e8c/1752093390/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752096253","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3447090/1660858832/a0dc68336a50d4816e8b308405406299bbff6e8c/1752093390/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752096253","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3447090/1660858832/a0dc68336a50d4816e8b308405406299bbff6e8c/1752093390/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752096253","id":257151588,"name":"Digitalink Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151588/3ccf35a8694a491bc9393afdb7598b467b83413f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752096253"}],"name":"Digitalink","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription"